/target
/.claude/

# Coverage and profiling output. An instrumented binary and `perf record` both write
# into the directory they were started from rather than into target/, so these are
# unanchored: they land next to whatever was run.
*.profraw
perf.data
perf.data.old

# Written without anyone asking, by editors and by the Finder. The project
# directories are anchored, since an editor puts them at the root of the tree it
# opened; the scratch files are not, since they appear beside the file being edited.
/.idea/
/.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.swp
